# Build context hygiene. node_modules alone is hundreds of megabytes and is rebuilt inside the
# image from the lockfile anyway, so shipping it would slow every build down for no benefit.
**/node_modules/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/dist/
**/.angular/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Not needed to build or run the image.
tests/
docs/
sample/
tools/bin/
*.md
*.sln
